{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your experience to the next level with this innovative \u201cIncubator Aquarium\u201d featuring thousands of automaton cells!\ud83e\udda0 Inspired by the life simulator from mathematician Conway\u2019s incredible \u2018Game of Life\ud83e\uddec\u2019. Embark on an incremental \u2018Idle\u2019 adventure where the goal is to colonize and evolve a new species on Earth, where experimentation\ud83e\uddebto survive is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/clipCells.gif?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony whenever conditions are optimal, create organic structures to generate energy and feed the cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/parasito.jpg?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or create an immune system to defend against parasites and viruses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/clipParasito.gif?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore multicellular organisms, collect essential molecules and foster chemical bonds essential for life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/mineDefense.jpg?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The perfect combination of chemical elements will be crucial for prosperity, although it will not always be easy to reproduce it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/simon.jpg?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a wide variety of mini-games that will catapult you towards colony improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/miniGames4.jpg?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness the birth of a new species based on just four mathematical rules to create a vibrant and innovative colony you can't miss!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574920?t=1745084221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574920?t=1745084221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/30d77c26df4ddbea9a7de3325a8f5a18617bddce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745084221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/30d77c26df4ddbea9a7de3325a8f5a18617bddce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745084221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3598850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your experience to the next level with this innovative \u201cIncubator Aquarium\u201d featuring thousands of automaton cells!\ud83e\udda0 Inspired by the life simulator from mathematician Conway\u2019s incredible \u2018Game of Life\ud83e\uddec\u2019. Embark on an incremental \u2018Idle\u2019 adventure where the goal is to colonize and evolve a new species on Earth, where experimentation\ud83e\uddebto survive is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574920/extras/clipCells.gif?t=1745084221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your colony whenever conditions are optimal, create organic structures to generate energy and feed the cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/